## Resolution

```js
uid, local = divmod(mat, 1000)
pack = mapping[uid]
sprite = pack.mat.cfg [素材][local]
```

- Missing local stays missing. **No `框架` cross-pack borrow.**
- `native.frameBorrow` stays `false`.
- Read-only `aliases` may decode extra paper UIDs (6→toy, 9→flower2, 17→paradise). Do not put aliases into `mapping`, or export will rewrite them.
- Export of 花卉 uses 7 (café-proven); export of 植物 uses 8 (fence-paper-proven). UID 9 decodes as flower2 but never exports. Toy is alias 6 only.
- Center only records with `0 ≤ x,y ≤ 2047`. Do not use wrapped uint15 outliers.

